            },
            "reviewBody": "I had an entire chicken, that was cut-up. I wanted enough of the seasoning so I increased water to 4 Tablespoons and the oil to 3 Tablespoons. It also made it thin enough to brush it on. I brushed some under the skin and then baked as directed.\n\nMy husband lived it.",
