              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "foxmomx3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! As other reviewers stated, I used Italian dressing instead of plain oil to add to the dry dressing. I used boneless chicken tenders and added mushrooms, red pepper slices and chopped onion on top of the chicken. Next time, I will marinate for an hour before placing in oven. I will make this again.",
