            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a good, simple recipe for a baked chicken breast. I made just two chicken breasts, but used the full recipe for the dressing mixture since they were quite large. I lifted the skin and smeared some of the dressing underneath. The chicken was very flavorful and moist with a nicely crisp skin.",
