              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I dredged the breasts in flour, dipped them in beaten eggs, and breaded them in Italian-style bread crumbs before putting them into the pan. Then, I poured the dressing mixture over them. I also doubled the amount of the dressing mixture. When I turned the breasts over, I placed a dab of butter over each piece. Came out tasty, but nothing mindblowing. I'll make it again, nice and easy.",
